<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kohl's cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kohl's cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had downgraded its rating of Kohl's Corp to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage also said it kept the retailer at long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 39-7/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
